IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `pwa-coverage`

-- Platform Workers Act 2024, ss 3 to 7, 16 to 18, 36 and the First and Second Schedules -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_pwa.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

§ `Fixtures`

`an app that allocates jobs by algorithm and sets service rules` MEANS Control WITH
    `uses data algorithmically to decide eligibility, allocation or pay` IS TRUE
    `routine human intervention in that use` IS FALSE
    `imposes a Second Schedule requirement other than one required by law` IS TRUE
    `tasks are accessed through the operator's app or website under a platform work agreement` IS FALSE
    `the operator disproves control` IS FALSE

`a platform where staff hand-pick every job` MEANS Control WITH
