#ASSERT NOT `the operator exercises management control` `an app-based platform that disproves control`
#ASSERT NOT `the operator exercises management control` `an algorithmic platform imposing no restrictions`

#ASSERT `the restriction is in the Second Schedule` `service quality standards`
